  "title": "Peanut Butter Pie II",
  "description": "A very chunky peanut butter batter is whipped up with corn syrup, eggs, sugar, butter, vanilla and chunky peanut butter. The filling is poured into a prepared pie crust, baked, chilled, and topped with a fabulous caramel cream sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Stephanie"
